            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='20800' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='10800'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontsize='12'>The overall goal, motivation and definitions for this dashboard are discussed in the document </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Fintech Tech KPIs</run>
                <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pzX3nIOlylpdmW919HVI9f_IGa9pvecYbe3Ejx9I9AY/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pzX3nIOlylpdmW919HVI9f_IGa9pvecYbe3Ejx9I9AY/edit?usp=sharing</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Data sources (tab data_source logic):</run>
                <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ZXbwLFSezyjp8fRA8bzdX3U0oPE31TObkRRKEOvX2Sw/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ZXbwLFSezyjp8fRA8bzdX3U0oPE31TObkRRKEOvX2Sw/edit?usp=sharing</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='15'>Known Issues</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='12'>- Deleted Jira tickets are not removed from the data source because Jira API does not send a signal for ticket deletion. This causes the number of open Bugs/Stability Tasks be higher than reflected in Jira. Issue is discussed in this Slack thread </run>
                <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://deliveryhero.slack.com/archives/C021L9T4CQ4/p1737125194485049?thread_ts=1737103906.525429&amp;amp;cid=C021L9T4CQ4&amp;quot;'>https://deliveryhero.slack.com/archives/C021L9T4CQ4/p1737125194485049?thread_ts=1737103906.525429&amp;cid=C021L9T4CQ4</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
